  o Major bugfixes (security):
    - Mark the P-224 TLS key negotiation group as optional.  In
      OpenSSL 4.x, this group is absent; but because we had not
      marked the group as optional, OpenSSL 4.x was rejecting our
      entire group list, and falling back to using its default
      group list.  Fixes bug 41477; bugfix on 0.4.8.17.
      Tracked as TROVE-2026-074.
